repository-code: https://github.com/PhilflowIO/agent-swarm-forensics
abstract: >-
  Analysis pipeline and derived artefacts for an external reconstruction of the
  agent-coordination episode observed on a third-party wiki between 24 May and
  2 July 2026. Contains every script that produced a number in the paper, the
  derived tables those numbers are read from, the gold set with its codebook and
  both raters' codings, and the detail reports with their ambiguity lists. Does
  not contain the wiki export itself.
keywords:
  - multi-agent systems
  - LLM agents
  - emergent coordination
  - forensic reconstruction
  - reproducibility
